"; font-weight:bold;}\n.rt-8fca7d8178 span.BodyTextChar {mso-style-name:\"Body Text Char\"; mso-style-link:\"Body Text\"; font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;}\n.rt-8fca7d8178 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657216;left:-118px;\r\ntop:18px;width:1087px;height:20px'><img width=870 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhPwQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAA\/BAIAgAAAAAAAAAJIBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsCh8Iiz0BMGpfKJvPpjEKn0ir1as1it9ou9+sNg3MFADs=\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h2 align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGINE<\/span><\/h2>\r\n\r\n<h1 align=center style='text-align:center'><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2-D; COLOUR AND\r\nSPECTRAL DOPPLER STUDY OF LOWER LIMB [ ARTERY ]<\/span><\/u><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>[Bilateral \/\r\nRight \/ Left]<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>ARTERIES EXAMINED<\/span><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nCommon femoral artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nSuperficial femoral artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>* Deep femoral artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nPopliteal artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nAnterior tibial artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nPosterior tibial artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nPeroneal artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\nArteria dorsalis pedis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>REPORT :<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>All arteries show normal flow spectrum\r\nwith peak systolic velocities within normal range. Diastolic forward flow is\r\npreserved. No significant luminal stenosis \/ localised turbulence noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoBodyText><span lang=EN-US>Arterial wall is apparently normal with\r\nno obvious plaque lesion.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h5><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif;\r\nfont-style:normal'>ARTERY\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0PVS\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 [cm\/Sec]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n[PSV :- Peak systolic velocity]<\/span><\/h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/b><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0\r\n style='border-collapse:collapse;border:none'>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=229 valign=top style='width:171.75pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*\r\n  Common femoral artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 valign=top style='width:54.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookma